<title>USA: Air Force awards cleanup contracts to three firms.</title>
<headline>Air Force awards cleanup contracts to three firms.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Air Force said on Tuesday that it awarded $171 million contracts to each of three companies for ab environmental cleanup at McClellan Air Force Base and other sites in its region in California.</p>
<p>It said it awarded the contracts to URS-Laidlaw, Joint Venture; Radian International and Metcalf Eddy METRIC Team, all of Sacramento.</p>
